    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><ref refid="classSawyer_1_1Container_1_1Map" kindref="compound">Map</ref> based index is the default index type when indexes are present.</para><para>This index has O(log N) insert, erase, and lookup times. The key type must have a less-than operator.</para><para>The semantics for the methods of this class are documented in the <ref refid="classSawyer_1_1Container_1_1GraphVoidIndex" kindref="compound">GraphVoidIndex</ref> class. </para>    </detaileddescription>
